        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Laurey 239, Contemporary Cabinet Hardware Pull</b>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 5 Inch Contemporary Cabinet Pull is part of the <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=Laurey+Kama\">Laurey Kama Collection</a> that exemplifies interesting style and modern design. The 5 Inch Kama Contemporary Pull is available in a few different finish color options. Each cabinet pull comes individually packaged with mounting hardware. This Modern Kitchen Hardware is easy to care for; the sleek design can be easily wiped down with a damp cloth. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Laurey Contemporary Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screws and 1-1/2\"  long #8-32 screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
